  headline: 'The Perseus Family: The Hero and the Royal Court',
  description: 'Guide to the Perseus family of constellations — Perseus, Andromeda, Cassiopeia, Cepheus, Pegasus, Cetus, Auriga, Lacerta and Triangulum. The autumn sky’s great mythological drama and its deep-sky wonders.',
