            <li><a href="https://www.iau.org/public/themes/constellations/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IAU Constellations</a> — Official boundaries of the Perseus family constellations</li>
            <li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perseus_(constellation)" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Perseus on Wikipedia</a> — The constellation, its stars, and mythology</li>
            <li><a href="https://www.messier.seds.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEDS Messier Catalog</a> — Data on M31, M33, and the Auriga clusters</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- FAQ Section -->
